For an initial condition given by:
\begin{equation}
u_0 = \Bigg{\{}
\begin{aligned}
&\sin(x)-1 \quad -\pi/2< x \leq 0 \\
&\sin(x)+1 \quad \quad 0 < x < \pi/2\\
\end{aligned}
